00:10:07.553 --> 00:10:08.953
♪ Show the what, and hide the how. ♪

167
00:10:08.953 --> 00:10:10.373
♪ Change the how, but keep the what — ♪

168
00:10:10.373 --> 00:10:17.033
♪ (but keep the what!) You change one module. (Only one!) ♪

169
00:10:17.433 --> 00:10:26.194
(narrator) The outro: eight programs that each copied the two-digit year turn red, costing billions; then one Dates module hides the year format, and only one module changes.

170
00:10:26.194 --> 00:10:28.022
(narrator) Designing for change, in big type.

171
00:10:28.022 --> 00:10:32.698
(narrator) Your hero sits at the laptop with a sticker that says shh, every module keeps a secret.

172
00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:37.900
Two digits, copied everywhere, cost billions.

173
00:10:38.180 --> 00:10:44.620
One decision, hidden in one module? You change one module.

174
00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:47.380
